{"id":"kabzeel","name":"Kabzeel","aliases":[],"sources":["nave","easton"],"topics":["nave:kabzeel"],"groups":[],"definition":{"source":"easton","term":"Kabzeel","text":"Gathering of God, a city in the extreme south of Judah, near to Idumaea (Josh. 15:21), the birthplace of Benaiah, one of David’s chief warriors (2 Sam. 23:20; 1 Chr. 11:22). It was called also Jekabzeel (Neh. 11:25), after the Captivity."},"lemmas":[{"strong":"H6909","lemma":"קַבְצְאֵל","xlit":"Qabtsᵉʼêl","gloss":"Kabtseel, a place in Palestine","kjv":"Kabzeel","count":3,"share":1},{"strong":"H1121","lemma":"בֵּן","xlit":"bên","gloss":"a son , in the widest sense , etc.)","kjv":"afflicted, age, ite, ed one","count":3,"share":1}],"verses":["Josh.15.21","2Sam.23.20","1Chr.11.22"],"related":[{"id":"abdon","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"accursed","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"achbor","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"adaiah","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"adrammelech","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"},{"id":"aharah","type":"lexical","strong":"H1121","why":"both lead with בֵּן (H1121)"}],"works":[]}
